# After S-944, Integer and String are plain VarRefs (Pattern::TypeAssertPending is deleted).
# Integer resolves to TypeNode.Int (a variant); String resolves to TypeNode.String (a variant).
# Pin comparisons: primitive_eq(42, TypeNode.Int) = false, primitive_eq(42, TypeNode.String) = false.
# The wildcard arm fires.
[match 42
    Integer:  "number"
    String:   "string"
    ...:      "other"]
=== out
String("other")
